{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Black Screen": 3,
    "Citlali": 23,
    "Paimon": 13,
    "Player": 8,
    "Xilonen": 18
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "503601",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "50230901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "50230901": {
            "id": "50230901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Oh, it's you two. The party's over, I'm guessing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230902"
            ]
          },
          "50230902": {
            "id": "50230902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? You knew about that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230903"
            ]
          },
          "50230903": {
            "id": "50230903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Of course! Everyone in Natlan is rooting for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230904"
            ]
          },
          "50230904": {
            "id": "50230904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Xilonen is working on the last part of your Ancient Name. It's best not to bother her when she's in the zone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230905"
            ]
          },
          "50230905": {
            "id": "50230905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Your Name is a special case. There were quite a few headaches along the way, which slowed the progress.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230906"
            ]
          },
          "50230906": {
            "id": "50230906",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is already faster than I expected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230907"
            ]
          },
          "50230907": {
            "id": "50230907",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I told Xilonen, if we hurry, we might make it to the feast in time to snag the last round of barbecue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230908"
            ]
          },
          "50230908": {
            "id": "50230908",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I was just teasing, but she gave it some serious thought, nodded, and really hit the ground running after that... It's like my joke lit a fire under her or something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230909"
            ]
          },
          "50230909": {
            "id": "50230909",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds like she really wanted that barbecue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230910"
            ]
          },
          "50230910": {
            "id": "50230910",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Yeah, it's a favorite in her tribe. I bet she still hasn't realized the feast is already over...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230911"
            ]
          },
          "50230911": {
            "id": "50230911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, should we go make some for her, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230912"
            ]
          },
          "50230912": {
            "id": "50230912",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yeah, if she's looking forward to it that much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230913"
            ]
          },
          "50230913": {
            "id": "50230913",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "I appreciate the thought, but there's no need. I can tell what time it is — the light outside is a dead giveaway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230914"
            ]
          },
          "50230914": {
            "id": "50230914",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Besides, I knew it was a joke. But, we were having a serious conversation at the time, so I decided to give a serious response.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230915"
            ]
          },
          "50230915": {
            "id": "50230915",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230916"
            ]
          },
          "50230916": {
            "id": "50230916",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230917"
            ]
          },
          "50230917": {
            "id": "50230917",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "*ahem* Anyway, I have something more important to show you. Here, take a look.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230918"
            ]
          },
          "50230918": {
            "id": "50230918",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "WOW! It's your Ancient Name!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230919"
            ]
          },
          "50230919": {
            "id": "50230919",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "\"Tum{RUBY#[D]Hope}aini\"... a name surfaced from the very bottom of the river of souls. It means \"hope.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230920"
            ]
          },
          "50230920": {
            "id": "50230920",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "A light to guide us through the darkness, like the stars or the moon... It's a perfect fit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230921"
            ]
          },
          "50230921": {
            "id": "50230921",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Amazing! Does this name come with a cool chant like the others?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230922"
            ]
          },
          "50230922": {
            "id": "50230922",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "#Of course, but that'll come later. {NICKNAME} is the first bearer of this name — those words will emerge naturally during {M#his}{F#her} journey.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230923"
            ]
          },
          "50230923": {
            "id": "50230923",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Once you return triumphant from the battle, I'm sure you will have fully understood why the Lord of the Night chose this name for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230926"
            ]
          },
          "50230926": {
            "id": "50230926",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, getting this Name turned out to be easier than Paimon was expecting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230927"
            ]
          },
          "50230927": {
            "id": "50230927",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "It all came down to the Lord of the Night's power. This situation is the first of its kind. Heck, I doubt we'll ever get a chance like this again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230928"
            ]
          },
          "50230928": {
            "id": "50230928",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Imagine receiving that much help from the Lord of the Night only for our most trusted engraver to fail... That would have been so embarrassing for humanity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230929"
            ]
          },
          "50230929": {
            "id": "50230929",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Success was never a question. You just like to make things seem dramatic. It's all those novels you read...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230930"
            ]
          },
          "50230930": {
            "id": "50230930",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hey, it's not like I wanted you to fail! When you've been alive as long as me, you learn that anything can happen!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230931"
            ]
          },
          "50230931": {
            "id": "50230931",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay, okay. It all worked out in the end...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230932"
            ]
          },
          "50230932": {
            "id": "50230932",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Your Name was successfully forged, and it passed all my technical tests... But there's still one more step.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230933"
            ]
          },
          "50230933": {
            "id": "50230933",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "We need to make sure the name has accepted you, and will function normally in your possession.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230934"
            ]
          },
          "50230934": {
            "id": "50230934",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "An outlander has never received an Ancient Name before. I wouldn't be surprised if something equally unprecedented happens when you connect to it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230935"
            ]
          },
          "50230935": {
            "id": "50230935",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So you're saying, it's still too early to celebrate...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230936"
            ]
          },
          "50230936": {
            "id": "50230936",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, when it comes to something this important, we can't leave anything to chance. Let's run this final test!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230937"
            ]
          },
          "50230937": {
            "id": "50230937",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Don't worry, the process is simple. We can find a quiet place to test it out after dinner.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230938"
            ]
          },
          "50230938": {
            "id": "50230938",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Basically, I need to observe whether your soul can connect to the Ley Lines, and make sure there are no signs of rejection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230939"
            ]
          },
          "50230939": {
            "id": "50230939",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Last time, you essentially \"barged into\" the Night Kingdom, but now, we must make sure that it will truly accept you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230940"
            ]
          },
          "50230940": {
            "id": "50230940",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Just leave it to me — I'm a professional.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230941"
            ]
          },
          "50230941": {
            "id": "50230941",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Just like that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230942"
            ]
          },
          "50230942": {
            "id": "50230942",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Oh, and you can have the Pilgrim's Chronicle back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230943"
            ]
          },
          "50230943": {
            "id": "50230943",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? It wasn't destroyed?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230944"
            ]
          },
          "50230944": {
            "id": "50230944",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "If forging an Ancient Name consumed the memories used to create it, the first person to bear the name would never be remembered.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230945"
            ]
          },
          "50230945": {
            "id": "50230945",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "The Pilgrim's Chronicle is still the most significant proof of your adventures in Natlan.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230946"
            ]
          },
          "50230946": {
            "id": "50230946",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230947"
            ]
          },
          "50230947": {
            "id": "50230947",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "No need to make a fuss... Let's go eat. I'm starving.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230948"
            ]
          },
          "50230948": {
            "id": "50230948",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "C'mon, I'll take you to my favorite barbecue place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230949"
            ]
          },
          "50230949": {
            "id": "50230949",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hah, barbecue! See? I knew you couldn't resist!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230950"
            ]
          },
          "50230950": {
            "id": "50230950",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Oh, I forgot to mention... The place has top-tier alcohol as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230951"
            ]
          },
          "50230951": {
            "id": "50230951",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Well, what are we waiting for? Hop to it, people!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230952"
            ]
          },
          "50230952": {
            "id": "50230952",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You enjoy a delicious barbecue dinner together. It seems to be Xilonen and Citlali's first meal of the day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230953"
            ]
          },
          "50230953": {
            "id": "50230953",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The alcohol is equally delicious, but out of respect for the test that will come next, Citlali only takes a few sips.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230954"
            ]
          },
          "50230954": {
            "id": "50230954",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "After the meal, Xilonen heads back to retrieve her tools while you wait outside with Citlali.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230955"
            ]
          },
          "50230955": {
            "id": "50230955",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is something on your mind, Citlali? You barely had anything to drink at dinner...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230956"
            ]
          },
          "50230956": {
            "id": "50230956",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Heh, I didn't think anything could shake me at this age...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230957"
            ]
          },
          "50230957": {
            "id": "50230957",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "But, the closer we get to the final battle, the more worried I feel... You have an Ancient Name now, but the Ode of Resurrection only takes effect if you win.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50230958"
            ]
          },
          "50230958": {
            "id": "50230958",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "And, the Pyro Archon's fate... is pointing toward \"death.\""
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}